{"id":"n85605-2-8","stage":5,"title":"함축 · 蕴含","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n85605-2-8-1","ko":"주제의 함축이 드러난 부분을 찾았어요?","zh":"找到体现主题内涵的部分了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"주제의","meaning":"主题","explanation":"주제：主题；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"주제","audio":"/audio/09053ac2411bc4cdd44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91771","senseId":"2","lemma":"주제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주제의","audio":"/audio/bbc673dfe342cf19f4f3.mp3"}},{"text":"함축이","meaning":"蕴含，包含，含蕴，含蓄","explanation":"함축：蕴含，包含，含蕴，含蓄；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"함축","audio":"/audio/3fb31f93773570100b89.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85605","senseId":"2","lemma":"함축","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"함축이","audio":"/audio/d835c044573723e104df.mp3"}},{"text":"드러난","meaning":"露出，显现","explanation":"드러나다：露出，显现；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"드러나다","audio":"/audio/8bf25c80651e2ee1976a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15034","senseId":"1","lemma":"드러나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"드러난","audio":"/audio/611f886e22cf3f60acbb.mp3"}},{"text":"부분을","meaning":"部分","explanation":"부분：部分；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"부분","audio":"/audio/204cbadbdb5dd2ee0cb9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65853","senseId":"1","lemma":"부분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부분을","audio":"/audio/362b38408c4a5ad841a1.mp3"}},{"text":"찾았어요?","meaning":"寻，觅，访，寻找，查","explanation":"찾다：寻，觅，访，寻找，查；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"찾다","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57320","senseId":"1","lemma":"찾다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찾았어요","audio":"/audio/9fd43a34a16d05a77ce2.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"09053ac2411bc4cd","term":"주제","zh":"主题","audio":"/audio/09053ac2411bc4cdd44c.mp3","entryId":"91771","definition":"在小说、画、电影等艺术作品中，作者想表现的中心思想。","pronunciation":["주제"]},{"id":"3fb31f9377357010","term":"함축","zh":"蕴含，包含，含蕴，含蓄","audio":"/audio/3fb31f93773570100b89.mp3","entryId":"85605","definition":"语言或文章中含有许多意思。","pronunciation":["함축"]},{"id":"8bf25c80651e2ee1","term":"드러나다","zh":"露出，显现","audio":"/audio/8bf25c80651e2ee1976a.mp3","entryId":"15034","definition":"原本被遮掩的东西显露出来。","pronunciation":["드러나다"]},{"id":"204cbadbdb5dd2ee","term":"부분","zh":"部分","audio":"/audio/204cbadbdb5dd2ee0cb9.mp3","entryId":"65853","definition":"构成整体的小范围；或指把整体分为多个时的其中一个。","pronunciation":["부분"]},{"id":"0aa19509314fd879","term":"찾다","zh":"寻，觅，访，寻找，查","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3","entryId":"57320","definition":"为了得到某物或为了见某人而四处查找；或指得到此物或见此人。","pronunciation":["찯따"]}],"audio":"/audio/4110f402e4cbe2a9d19c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n85605-2-8-2","ko":"네, 마지막 단락인 것 같아요.","zh":"是的，应该是最后那段吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"마지막","meaning":"最后，最终，末了","explanation":"마지막：最后，最终，末了","readings":[{"term":"마지막","audio":"/audio/8da62ef6312ba9ce3e2e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28843","senseId":"1","lemma":"마지막","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마지막","audio":"/audio/8da62ef6312ba9ce3e2e.mp3"}},{"text":"단락인","meaning":"段，段落","explanation":"단락：段，段落；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"단락","audio":"/audio/98bf581dd5d0c19c46c2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24631","senseId":"2","lemma":"단락","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"단락인","audio":"/audio/0e5c3828265f56b79427.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아요.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아요","audio":"/audio/d27f58354e12c6dc5616.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"8da62ef6312ba9ce","term":"마지막","zh":"最后，最终，末了","audio":"/audio/8da62ef6312ba9ce3e2e.mp3","entryId":"28843","definition":"在时间上或次序上的末尾。","pronunciation":["마지막"]},{"id":"98bf581dd5d0c19c","term":"단락","zh":"段，段落","audio":"/audio/98bf581dd5d0c19c46c2.mp3","entryId":"24631","definition":"在文字、电影、音乐等中，由相同内容组成的一个个的短故事片段。","pronunciation":["달락"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/da6ea0182a612eaa9431.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.26,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=85605","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":154,"sequenceScore":3.0867,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["找到体现主题内涵的部分了吗？","是的，应该是最后那段吧。","看来学校里正在举办什么活动呢。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["找到体现主题内涵的部分了吗？","是的，应该是最后那段吧。","看来学校里正在举办什么活动呢。"],"answer":1}]}
